Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,240] | Elapsed:  16.49s | Words: 13 | Text: 每一个人他其实他都可以变得很厉害
Segment #2   [00:00:02,240 --> 00:00:02,920] | Elapsed:  16.49s | Words: 4  | Text: 就是我敢说
Segment #3   [00:00:03,280 --> 00:00:04,380] | Elapsed:  16.49s | Words: 5  | Text: 我要是不告诉你
Segment #4   [00:00:04,380 --> 00:00:06,160] | Elapsed:  16.49s | Words: 9  | Text: 你可能你自己务需要花很久
Segment #5   [00:00:06,160 --> 00:00:07,620] | Elapsed:  16.49s | Words: 7  | Text: 就是我是花过很多的钱
Segment #6   [00:00:07,620 --> 00:00:08,720] | Elapsed:  16.49s | Words: 6  | Text: 花过很多的教训
Segment #7   [00:00:08,720 --> 00:00:09,240] | Elapsed:  16.49s | Words: 3  | Text: 我才能
Segment #8   [00:00:09,240 --> 00:00:10,180] | Elapsed:  16.49s | Words: 6  | Text: 我才买回来的
Segment #9   [00:00:10,180 --> 00:00:11,460] | Elapsed:  16.49s | Words: 4  | Text: 就是每一个人
Segment #10  [00:00:11,460 --> 00:00:12,840] | Elapsed:  16.49s | Words: 7  | Text: 怎么样可以变得很厉害
Segment #11  [00:00:12,840 --> 00:00:13,740] | Elapsed:  16.49s | Words: 6  | Text: 他有三个答案
Segment #12  [00:00:13,740 --> 00:00:15,120] | Elapsed:  16.49s | Words: 8  | Text: 为什么我讲有三个答案
Segment #13  [00:00:15,120 --> 00:00:16,380] | Elapsed:  16.49s | Words: 9  | Text: 你比如说给大家举个例子
Segment #14  [00:00:16,380 --> 00:00:16,980] | Elapsed:  16.49s | Words: 3  | Text: 遇到问题
Segment #15  [00:00:16,980 --> 00:00:18,680] | Elapsed:  16.49s | Words: 8  | Text: 傻子会自己去想答案
Segment #16  [00:00:18,680 --> 00:00:19,480] | Elapsed:  16.49s | Words: 5  | Text: 他想不明白的
Segment #17  [00:00:19,480 --> 00:00:20,260] | Elapsed:  16.49s | Words: 5  | Text: 他真的想不明白
Segment #18  [00:00:20,260 --> 00:00:21,240] | Elapsed:  16.49s | Words: 7  | Text: 最快的方法是什么
Segment #19  [00:00:21,240 --> 00:00:23,880] | Elapsed:  16.49s | Words: 13 | Text: 就是聪明人他会直接花钱去买答案
Segment #20  [00:00:23,880 --> 00:00:24,640] | Elapsed:  16.49s | Words: 4  | Text: 因为所有的事情
Segment #21  [00:00:24,640 --> 00:00:26,320] | Elapsed:  16.49s | Words: 10 | Text: 他其实他都是有标准答案的
Segment #22  [00:00:26,320 --> 00:00:27,680] | Elapsed:  16.49s | Words: 6  | Text: 这个世界上所有的事情
Segment #23  [00:00:27,680 --> 00:00:29,060] | Elapsed:  16.49s | Words: 7  | Text: 都是有标准答案的
Segment #24  [00:00:29,060 --> 00:00:30,100] | Elapsed:  35.25s | Words: 7  | Text: 你找一个人问问的
Segment #25  [00:00:30,100 --> 00:00:31,580] | Elapsed:  35.25s | Words: 9  | Text: 问一问梅竹他就成了
Segment #26  [00:00:31,580 --> 00:00:33,420] | Elapsed:  35.25s | Words: 9  | Text: 梅竹你的问题他就通透了
Segment #27  [00:00:33,420 --> 00:00:35,600] | Elapsed:  35.25s | Words: 10 | Text: 就是我和一些高能量的人在一起
Segment #28  [00:00:36,140 --> 00:00:36,920] | Elapsed:  35.25s | Words: 5  | Text: 我就跟他们在一起
Segment #29  [00:00:36,920 --> 00:00:38,000] | Elapsed:  35.25s | Words: 7  | Text: 我不需要问任何的问题
Segment #30  [00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:38,960] | Elapsed:  35.25s | Words: 5  | Text: 我跟他们待着
Segment #31  [00:00:38,960 --> 00:00:39,940] | Elapsed:  35.25s | Words: 6  | Text: 就哪怕待在一起
Segment #32  [00:00:39,940 --> 00:00:41,940] | Elapsed:  35.25s | Words: 12 | Text: 有些问题我自然而然的我就通了
Segment #33  [00:00:41,940 --> 00:00:43,600] | Elapsed:  35.25s | Words: 7  | Text: 就是笨人自己想答案
Segment #34  [00:00:43,600 --> 00:00:46,000] | Elapsed:  35.25s | Words: 9  | Text: 聪明人花钱去买答案
Segment #35  [00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:46,720] | Elapsed:  35.25s | Words: 4  | Text: 但是我告诉你
Segment #36  [00:00:46,720 --> 00:00:48,700] | Elapsed:  35.25s | Words: 6  | Text: 真正问题的答案
Segment #37  [00:00:48,700 --> 00:00:49,300] | Elapsed:  35.25s | Words: 2  | Text: 买不到
Segment #38  [00:00:49,820 --> 00:00:51,000] | Elapsed:  35.25s | Words: 6  | Text: 你自己也想不出来
Segment #39  [00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:51,860] | Elapsed:  35.25s | Words: 3  | Text: 就是很多事情
Segment #40  [00:00:51,860 --> 00:00:53,480] | Elapsed:  35.25s | Words: 9  | Text: 很多人一辈子他没有前途
Segment #41  [00:00:53,480 --> 00:00:54,540] | Elapsed:  35.25s | Words: 4  | Text: 为什么没有前途
Segment #42  [00:00:54,540 --> 00:00:56,420] | Elapsed:  35.25s | Words: 11 | Text: 因为你总想一口吃个大泡了
Segment #43  [00:00:56,420 --> 00:00:58,140] | Elapsed:  35.25s | Words: 8  | Text: 你只有把你的心修练好的
Segment #44  [00:00:58,140 --> 00:00:58,780] | Elapsed:  55.37s | Words: 3  | Text: 你有意义
Segment #45  [00:00:58,780 --> 00:01:00,120] | Elapsed:  55.37s | Words: 7  | Text: 你能坚持你有内心
Segment #46  [00:01:00,120 --> 00:01:01,520] | Elapsed:  55.37s | Words: 8  | Text: 你能够就像我一样
Segment #47  [00:01:01,520 --> 00:01:02,820] | Elapsed:  55.37s | Words: 5  | Text: 你就坐在这个地方
Segment #48  [00:01:02,820 --> 00:01:04,000] | Elapsed:  55.37s | Words: 5  | Text: 你长时间的工作
Segment #49  [00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:05,600] | Elapsed:  55.37s | Words: 11 | Text: 我讲的这些东西才对你有用
Segment #50  [00:01:05,600 --> 00:01:07,360] | Elapsed:  55.37s | Words: 11 | Text: 你能不能一天坚持10个小时
Segment #51  [00:01:07,360 --> 00:01:09,400] | Elapsed:  55.37s | Words: 13 | Text: 你高强度的去直播去拍点视频
Segment #52  [00:01:09,400 --> 00:01:10,320] | Elapsed:  55.37s | Words: 6  | Text: 去优化演讲稿
Segment #53  [00:01:10,320 --> 00:01:11,340] | Elapsed:  55.37s | Words: 6  | Text: 去做你所有的工作
Segment #54  [00:01:11,340 --> 00:01:12,520] | Elapsed:  55.37s | Words: 5  | Text: 你能不能坚持
Segment #55  [00:01:12,520 --> 00:01:13,700] | Elapsed:  55.37s | Words: 7  | Text: 就不管给你什么项目
Segment #56  [00:01:13,700 --> 00:01:14,660] | Elapsed:  55.37s | Words: 6  | Text: 如果说你不坚持
Segment #57  [00:01:14,660 --> 00:01:15,700] | Elapsed:  55.37s | Words: 6  | Text: 这都是没有意义的
Segment #58  [00:01:15,700 --> 00:01:16,680] | Elapsed:  55.37s | Words: 5  | Text: 最快的办法
Segment #59  [00:01:16,680 --> 00:01:18,380] | Elapsed:  55.37s | Words: 9  | Text: 也是看起来最慢的办法
Segment #60  [00:01:18,380 --> 00:01:19,660] | Elapsed:  55.37s | Words: 7  | Text: 就是学一招用一招
Segment #61  [00:01:19,660 --> 00:01:20,980] | Elapsed:  55.37s | Words: 7  | Text: 这样的人他才能成功
Segment #62  [00:01:20,980 --> 00:01:21,780] | Elapsed:  55.37s | Words: 6  | Text: 他们像是在家里
Segment #63  [00:01:21,780 --> 00:01:22,900] | Elapsed:  55.37s | Words: 6  | Text: 写毛笔这一样
Segment #64  [00:01:22,900 --> 00:01:24,440] | Elapsed:  55.37s | Words: 6  | Text: 怎么学 写得最快
Segment #65  [00:01:24,440 --> 00:01:26,420] | Elapsed:  55.37s | Words: 9  | Text: 不是说你买了很多的毛笔
Segment #66  [00:01:26,420 --> 00:01:28,040] | Elapsed:  74.91s | Words: 8  | Text: 你去买了很多的字体
Segment #67  [00:01:28,040 --> 00:01:29,720] | Elapsed:  74.91s | Words: 7  | Text: 然后一个字一个字去写
Segment #68  [00:01:29,720 --> 00:01:31,560] | Elapsed:  74.91s | Words: 6  | Text: 这样学是最慢的
Segment #69  [00:01:31,560 --> 00:01:33,080] | Elapsed:  74.91s | Words: 8  | Text: 是用最愚蠢的办法
Segment #70  [00:01:33,080 --> 00:01:34,940] | Elapsed:  74.91s | Words: 9  | Text: 学练字就是最快的就是什么
Segment #71  [00:01:34,940 --> 00:01:35,420] | Elapsed:  74.91s | Words: 3  | Text: 我告诉你
Segment #72  [00:01:35,420 --> 00:01:36,260] | Elapsed:  74.91s | Words: 4  | Text: 你就写一个字
Segment #73  [00:01:36,260 --> 00:01:37,120] | Elapsed:  74.91s | Words: 5  | Text: 叫永远的用
Segment #74  [00:01:37,120 --> 00:01:38,260] | Elapsed:  74.91s | Words: 5  | Text: 你就只写一个用
Segment #75  [00:01:38,260 --> 00:01:39,420] | Elapsed:  74.91s | Words: 6  | Text: 你把它写一万遍
Segment #76  [00:01:39,420 --> 00:01:39,780] | Elapsed:  74.91s | Words: 1  | Text: 为什么
Segment #77  [00:01:39,780 --> 00:01:41,700] | Elapsed:  74.91s | Words: 5  | Text: 一点 一横 一数
Segment #78  [00:01:41,700 --> 00:01:43,260] | Elapsed:  74.91s | Words: 6  | Text: 一招 一撇一纳
Segment #79  [00:01:43,260 --> 00:01:44,420] | Elapsed:  74.91s | Words: 4  | Text: 这个用这个字
Segment #80  [00:01:44,420 --> 00:01:46,480] | Elapsed:  74.91s | Words: 7  | Text: 它是点 横 数 撇纳
Segment #81  [00:01:46,480 --> 00:01:46,880] | Elapsed:  74.91s | Words: 2  | Text: 它都有
Segment #82  [00:01:46,880 --> 00:01:48,360] | Elapsed:  74.91s | Words: 7  | Text: 你只需要练这一招
Segment #83  [00:01:48,360 --> 00:01:49,600] | Elapsed:  74.91s | Words: 6  | Text: 练到一模一样
Segment #84  [00:01:49,600 --> 00:01:51,240] | Elapsed:  74.91s | Words: 9  | Text: 就是这个比一练就是十几天
Segment #85  [00:01:51,240 --> 00:01:52,960] | Elapsed:  74.91s | Words: 10 | Text: 有可能你三个两个月过后
Segment #86  [00:01:52,960 --> 00:01:53,980] | Elapsed:  74.91s | Words: 6  | Text: 你就大功告成了
Segment #87  [00:01:53,980 --> 00:01:54,780] | Elapsed:  74.91s | Words: 5  | Text: 所以说练东西
Segment #88  [00:01:54,780 --> 00:01:55,860] | Elapsed:  74.91s | Words: 7  | Text: 它只能一点点的练
Segment #89  [00:01:55,860 --> 00:01:57,200] | Elapsed:  95.37s | Words: 6  | Text: 就是永远的这个用
Segment #90  [00:01:57,200 --> 00:01:58,400] | Elapsed:  95.37s | Words: 7  | Text: 你们就练这个字就行
Segment #91  [00:01:58,400 --> 00:02:00,640] | Elapsed:  95.37s | Words: 10 | Text: 没有专注力和耐心怎么培养
Segment #92  [00:02:00,640 --> 00:02:02,000] | Elapsed:  95.37s | Words: 5  | Text: 你比如说占装
Segment #93  [00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:03,640] | Elapsed:  95.37s | Words: 6  | Text: 那我就发现我很烦
Segment #94  [00:02:03,640 --> 00:02:04,380] | Elapsed:  95.37s | Words: 4  | Text: 我就占不住
Segment #95  [00:02:04,380 --> 00:02:05,120] | Elapsed:  95.37s | Words: 4  | Text: 但是没关系
Segment #96  [00:02:05,120 --> 00:02:06,280] | Elapsed:  95.37s | Words: 7  | Text: 我占一秒是一秒
Segment #97  [00:02:06,280 --> 00:02:07,280] | Elapsed:  95.37s | Words: 6  | Text: 占两秒是两秒
Segment #98  [00:02:07,280 --> 00:02:08,320] | Elapsed:  95.37s | Words: 6  | Text: 耐心和专注力
Segment #99  [00:02:08,320 --> 00:02:09,920] | Elapsed:  95.37s | Words: 10 | Text: 就是一秒一秒培养起来的
Segment #100 [00:02:09,920 --> 00:02:13,020] | Elapsed:  95.37s | Words: 12 | Text: 一秒 两秒 三秒 四秒 五秒 六秒
Segment #101 [00:02:13,020 --> 00:02:13,760] | Elapsed:  95.37s | Words: 3  | Text: 你就这样数
Segment #102 [00:02:13,760 --> 00:02:14,500] | Elapsed:  95.37s | Words: 5  | Text: 你数到一万
Segment #103 [00:02:14,500 --> 00:02:15,500] | Elapsed:  95.37s | Words: 6  | Text: 你停不下来的时候
Segment #104 [00:02:15,500 --> 00:02:16,580] | Elapsed:  95.37s | Words: 6  | Text: 实际上你的耐心
Segment #105 [00:02:16,580 --> 00:02:17,940] | Elapsed:  95.37s | Words: 10 | Text: 和你的专注力它都会提升
Segment #106 [00:02:17,940 --> 00:02:19,040] | Elapsed:  95.37s | Words: 5  | Text: 你进步很慢
Segment #107 [00:02:19,040 --> 00:02:19,760] | Elapsed:  95.37s | Words: 4  | Text: 无所谓的
Segment #108 [00:02:19,760 --> 00:02:20,940] | Elapsed:  95.37s | Words: 5  | Text: 你就慢慢的去做
Segment #109 [00:02:20,940 --> 00:02:21,880] | Elapsed:  95.37s | Words: 5  | Text: 你只要去做
Segment #110 [00:02:21,880 --> 00:02:23,100] | Elapsed:  95.37s | Words: 5  | Text: 你想去做的事情
Segment #111 [00:02:23,100 --> 00:02:24,120] | Elapsed:  95.37s | Words: 6  | Text: 你只要把它做好了
Segment #112 [00:02:24,120 --> 00:02:25,400] | Elapsed: 115.67s | Words: 7  | Text: 就没有你做不到的事情
Segment #113 [00:02:25,400 --> 00:02:27,140] | Elapsed: 115.67s | Words: 9  | Text: 所以说在这个角度上来讲
Segment #114 [00:02:27,140 --> 00:02:28,880] | Elapsed: 115.67s | Words: 11 | Text: 每一个人他都可以变得很厉害
Segment #115 [00:02:28,880 --> 00:02:31,440] | Elapsed: 115.67s | Words: 10 | Text: 一个人傻是因为他自己愿意傻
Segment #116 [00:02:31,440 --> 00:02:33,320] | Elapsed: 115.67s | Words: 8  | Text: 是他因为他选择了傻
Segment #117 [00:02:33,320 --> 00:02:34,160] | Elapsed: 115.67s | Words: 4  | Text: 一个人贫穷
Segment #118 [00:02:34,160 --> 00:02:35,760] | Elapsed: 115.67s | Words: 8  | Text: 是因为他选择了贫穷
Segment #119 [00:02:35,760 --> 00:02:36,660] | Elapsed: 115.67s | Words: 4  | Text: 一个人富有
Segment #120 [00:02:36,660 --> 00:02:37,720] | Elapsed: 115.67s | Words: 7  | Text: 一个人去做短人贫
Segment #121 [00:02:37,720 --> 00:02:39,900] | Elapsed: 115.67s | Words: 11 | Text: 也是因为他选择了去做短人贫
Segment #122 [00:02:39,900 --> 00:02:40,680] | Elapsed: 115.67s | Words: 3  | Text: 人生来
Segment #123 [00:02:40,680 --> 00:02:41,740] | Elapsed: 115.67s | Words: 6  | Text: 究竟是穷是富
Segment #124 [00:02:41,740 --> 00:02:42,580] | Elapsed: 115.67s | Words: 5  | Text: 没有人限制你
Segment #125 [00:02:42,580 --> 00:02:43,560] | Elapsed: 115.67s | Words: 6  | Text: 都是你自己做成的
Segment #126 [00:02:43,560 --> 00:02:44,380] | Elapsed: 115.67s | Words: 6  | Text: 你不要光聊出身
Segment #127 [00:02:44,380 --> 00:02:45,620] | Elapsed: 115.67s | Words: 7  | Text: 星巴的出身高吗
Segment #128 [00:02:45,620 --> 00:02:46,600] | Elapsed: 115.67s | Words: 7  | Text: 马云的出身高吗
Segment #129 [00:02:46,600 --> 00:02:47,720] | Elapsed: 115.67s | Words: 8  | Text: 刘强东的出身高吗
Segment #130 [00:02:47,720 --> 00:02:48,940] | Elapsed: 115.67s | Words: 9  | Text: 澳门渡载的出身高吗
Segment #131 [00:02:48,940 --> 00:02:50,940] | Elapsed: 115.67s | Words: 11 | Text: 你也不要告诉我是信任图纸偏差
Segment #132 [00:02:50,940 --> 00:02:52,420] | Elapsed: 135.41s | Words: 8  | Text: 你看看现在做互联网的
Segment #133 [00:02:52,420 --> 00:02:54,280] | Elapsed: 135.41s | Words: 12 | Text: 100个人当中有多少人能赚到钱
Segment #134 [00:02:54,280 --> 00:02:55,800] | Elapsed: 135.41s | Words: 7  | Text: 我们不比具体数字
Segment #135 [00:02:55,800 --> 00:02:57,420] | Elapsed: 135.41s | Words: 9  | Text: 你看看你们现在做实体链的
Segment #136 [00:02:57,420 --> 00:02:58,380] | Elapsed: 135.41s | Words: 6  | Text: 100个做实体的
Segment #137 [00:02:58,380 --> 00:02:59,500] | Elapsed: 135.41s | Words: 8  | Text: 和100个做互联网的
Segment #138 [00:02:59,500 --> 00:03:00,660] | Elapsed: 135.41s | Words: 8  | Text: 你告诉我哪个赚钱多
Segment #139 [00:03:00,660 --> 00:03:02,180] | Elapsed: 135.41s | Words: 9  | Text: 做实体的100个人亏了
Segment #140 [00:03:02,180 --> 00:03:02,780] | Elapsed: 135.41s | Words: 4  | Text: 得亏很多钱
Segment #141 [00:03:02,780 --> 00:03:04,380] | Elapsed: 135.41s | Words: 7  | Text: 做互联网干成了
Segment #142 [00:03:04,380 --> 00:03:06,020] | Elapsed: 135.41s | Words: 10 | Text: 成功的上线是无上线的
Segment #143 [00:03:06,020 --> 00:03:06,560] | Elapsed: 135.41s | Words: 4  | Text: 干失败了
Segment #144 [00:03:06,560 --> 00:03:08,060] | Elapsed: 135.41s | Words: 7  | Text: 他没有任何的损失
Segment #145 [00:03:08,060 --> 00:03:10,020] | Elapsed: 135.41s | Words: 9  | Text: 你不要过聊幸存者偏差
Segment #146 [00:03:10,020 --> 00:03:11,220] | Elapsed: 135.41s | Words: 5  | Text: 幸存者偏差
Segment #147 [00:03:11,220 --> 00:03:13,400] | Elapsed: 135.41s | Words: 9  | Text: 本质还是你对于你自己的
Segment #148 [00:03:14,500 --> 00:03:15,360] | Elapsed: 135.41s | Words: 4  | Text: 找的借口
Segment #149 [00:03:15,360 --> 00:03:17,660] | Elapsed: 135.41s | Words: 12 | Text: 那我告诉你什么叫做幸存者偏差
Segment #150 [00:03:17,660 --> 00:03:18,840] | Elapsed: 135.41s | Words: 6  | Text: 你总看到我起来了
Segment #151 [00:03:18,840 --> 00:03:20,560] | Elapsed: 145.14s | Words: 8  | Text: 你说不是所有人都能成为
Segment #152 [00:03:20,560 --> 00:03:21,360] | Elapsed: 145.14s | Words: 6  | Text: 第二个傲民兜载
Segment #153 [00:03:21,360 --> 00:03:22,740] | Elapsed: 145.14s | Words: 7  | Text: 那我想反悔你们一句
Segment #154 [00:03:22,740 --> 00:03:23,480] | Elapsed: 145.14s | Words: 2  | Text: 那为什么
Segment #155 [00:03:23,480 --> 00:03:26,160] | Elapsed: 145.14s | Words: 10 | Text: 哪怕世界上只有一个傲民兜载
Segment #156 [00:03:26,160 --> 00:03:26,960] | Elapsed: 145.14s | Words: 5  | Text: 这个傲民兜载
Segment #157 [00:03:26,960 --> 00:03:28,060] | Elapsed: 145.14s | Words: 5  | Text: 为什么不能是你呢
Segment #158 [00:03:28,060 --> 00:03:29,080] | Elapsed: 145.14s | Words: 4  | Text: 为什么不能是你
